#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""List, search, remove or resume coding-agent sessions (Claude Code, Codex,
OpenCode, Antigravity). With no arguments, open the interactive menu; -l lists
them instead; -a covers every directory, not just $PWD. Press / in the menu to
search.

To support another agent, subclass `Agent` and add an instance to `AGENTS`.
"""

